Hi folks,

The PSI/1.0 Requirements spec has passed last call and
formal vote and will soon be issued as an IEEE/ISTO
PWG Candidate Standard.

The PSI/1.0 Protocol spec has just begun a 4-week last
call (see below).  

Results of the PSI/1.0 Protocol spec last call will 
be discussed at the PSI meeting on Monday afternoon
(23 Feb) during the next PWG face-to-face meeting
- in the San Jose, CA area - exact location still to
be determined.

Cheers,
